 "final_passage": "Glimmer (full) achieves higher relation F1 than Trellis-RE on Hollin-DocRE (65.2% vs 61.8%) and Saltmarsh-Bio (55.9% vs 52.3%), but lower F1 on Wistmoor-News (69.2% vs 70.0%). Removing the evidence-gating module decreases F1 on Hollin-DocRE (63.0% vs 65.2%) and Saltmarsh-Bio (54.1% vs 55.9%), but increases F1 on Wistmoor-News (72.4% vs 69.2%). Thus, the evidence-gating module's benefit is inconsistent across domains: it improves performance in the in-domain and biomedical settings but hurts performance on the news test set. No statistical tests were reported, so these differences may not be significant.",
